# Battle against Type: Null (the masked synthetic): the family's motif (a fifth up from the tonic, a leap to the
# ninth that falls back, then a step down from the fourth and a leap to the fifth) held in by an A-minor square lead,
# clipped and low, over brass and a plodding heavy beat. Silvally sings the same motif freed. Original composition for this game.
